W3C is a trademark of the World Wide Web Consortium. This package implements the ecdsa-sd-2023 cryptosuite of the W3C
Recommendation Data Integrity ECDSA Cryptosuites v1.0. It is not certified or endorsed by W3C and includes no W3C files: the
contexts and the test vectors that its tests read are downloaded at pinned hashes and never committed.

